WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.928
Pharaoh ordered all baby boys to be killed. But Musa's mother followed Allah's guidance. She placed her little baby in a basket and set it on the Nile.

2
00:00:09.328 --> 00:00:14.968
The basket floated to the palace. Pharaoh's wife Asiya found the baby, and she loved him dearly.

3
00:00:15.368 --> 00:00:25.136
The little baby would not take milk from any nurse. In Allah's wonderful plan, his own mother came to care for him, and the family was together again.

4
00:00:25.536 --> 00:00:30.288
Musa grew up in the palace. He was upright and kind, always helping others.

5
00:00:30.688 --> 00:00:38.560
In the sacred valley of Tuwa, he saw a holy light. Allah said to him, I am your Lord. Take off your shoes.

6
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:46.400
Allah chose Musa as a prophet and gave him two miracles: his staff turned into a great serpent, and his hand shone with light.

7
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.408
Musa set out on his mission. Trust in Allah. Allah always has the best plan.
